	"changesets": [
		{
			"path": ".changeset/1794201799-pina-cli.md",
			"summary": "Add additive rust-kit Solana Kit client generation",
			"details": "Opt-in `--client rust-kit` / `[clients.rust_kit]` generates off-chain Rust clients via `codama-renderers-rust-solana-kit@0.2.1` under `src/generated/`, scaffolding `solana_kit_core` 0.2.1 from crates.io. Defaults stay rust + typescript; rust and cli-rust are unchanged; no cli-rust-kit.\n\nAdding `ClientLanguage::RustKit` is a public enum extension (exhaustiveness), so this is a major bump for `pina_cli` even though the CLI surface is additive.\n\n##### User impact\n\nYou can add `rust-kit` to `clients.languages` or pass `--client rust-kit` to generate a Solana Kit Rust client beside the existing PinaPod `rust` client. `pina init` defaults are unchanged. Fresh scaffolds pin `solana_kit_core = \"0.2.1\"` from crates.io and put generated modules under `src/generated/`.\n\nThe agent skill's CLI and project-setup references document rust-kit as opt-in Solana Kit Rust client generation.",
			"targets": [
				{
					"id": "pina_cli",
					"kind": "package",
					"bump": "major",
					"origin": "direct-change",
					"evidence_refs": [],
